WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.425
An id names a place, and a # link jumps to it

2
00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:08.503
An id gives one element a name. This heading is named results.

3
00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:14.004
A link whose href starts with # jumps to the element with that name.

4
00:00:14.804 --> 00:00:19.404
The # is the difference. Without it, the browser looks for another page.
